This is an unofficial fan-made mod for GTFO. It is not made, endorsed or supported by 10 Chambers Collective.
GTFO and its game data belong to their owners; no file taken from the game is included in this package. The editor reads the game
installed on the user's own machine and never ships its files.

The plugin (the zip on Thunderstore) carries no third-party code. It depends on the ForgeCore package (MIT, NAinfini), which
decodes the skins' sounds and carries its own notices.

